Z||000005||Cheever3000||10-19-2001||09:15 PM||||I like Mustangs.<P>It would not be as easy to customize or to work on yourself.  It would cost more than I could afford, just like the original was when they were new.  Yes it would have a little more horsepower but would be a whiny-sounding crap-mobile that still needs a V8 or 3800SC and still needs the top chopped.  And it would still need better brakes but they would be ABS so that would be okay I guess.  We would have to turn off the airbags.  It would be heavier.  It would look darn silly, cause that's what Pontiac does these days.  The tires would still not be wide enough.<BR>||||reg||1
